# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
# the Dockerfile and uses it INSTEAD of the root .dockerignore). This image
# builds from the REPO ROOT, so allow-list exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs
# rather than uploading the whole repository (INF-017).
*
!examples/mcp-servers/http-gateway/server.js
!examples/mcp-servers/http-gateway/package.json
!examples/mcp-servers/home-assistant
# ...and never anything secret or local inside the allowed dirs.
**/node_modules
**/test
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
